{"title":"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of Zipporah’s age and Dina’s age is 51. The sum of Julio’s age and Dina’s age is 54. Zipporah is 7 years old. How old is Julio?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the sum of Zipporah's age and Dina's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1fd7cb028e27b8648efbfb002f3e6d4fcb33a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> and Zipporah's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Dina is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77ba9e97fa8f5fc31b2138b64d4846aab800857c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51 - 7 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> years old.\n</p><p>Since the sum of Julio's age and Dina's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1cb5bdce2d06d2419066a2b55ab01d824217bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> and Dina's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, Julio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46df9520f76f11286f58594465ca1625fc232f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54 - 44 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Shortcut.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Shortcut)\">Solution 2 (Shortcut)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Shortcut)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the sum of Julio's age and Dina's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than the sum of Zipporah's age and Dina's age, Julio's age must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than Zipporah's age.\n</p><p>Zipporah is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years old, meaning that Julio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2fe7b85a224984f68f542f104721ce7620fb6e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + 3 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC\" title=\"2019 CSMC\">2019 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1240/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1758/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.120      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.120      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37328:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062514 and revision id 288247. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}